's a developing move that improves my position without making positional concessions\n5. After castling, I can focus on developing my remaining pieces and creating threats\n\nThis is a fundamental principle: in the middlegame with pieces still on the board, king safety is paramount.\n\n**Answer:** K: e1-g1"}
